on setOutSprites1
  [  0] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [  3] pushint8 112 ............................ <112>
  [  6] pushint8 150 ............................ <150>
  [  9] pusharglist 2 ........................... <112, 150>
  [ 11] extcall 27 .............................. <point(112, 150)>
  [ 13] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 16] set 6 ................................... set the loc of sprite 6 to point(112, 150)
  [ 18] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 21] pushint8 330 ............................ <330>
  [ 24] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 27] pusharglist 2 ........................... <330, 100>
  [ 29] extcall 27 .............................. <point(330, 100)>
  [ 31] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 34] set 6 ................................... set the loc of sprite 7 to point(330, 100)
  [ 36] pushint8 8 .............................. <8>
  [ 39] pushint8 550 ............................ <550>
  [ 42] pushint8 145 ............................ <145>
  [ 45] pusharglist 2 ........................... <550, 145>
  [ 47] extcall 27 .............................. <point(550, 145)>
  [ 49] pushint8 33 ............................. <33>
  [ 52] set 6 ................................... set the loc of sprite 8 to point(550, 145)
  [ 54] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 57] setglobal 30 ............................ holdStage = 1
  [ 59] ret
end
